{"v":4,"catch":"快樂，尷尬，懷舊。","desc":"《TRIO THE PUNCH》是Data East於1990年發行的橫版動作遊戲。\n1990年，“三壯士”現身遊戲中心，被笑聲裹挾!?\n牧師咆哮！ 被羊詛咒！ 一個火辣辣的男人跑來跑去！\n\n“Arcade Archives”系列忠實再現了許多經典的Arcade傑作。\n玩家可以改變各種遊戲設置，例如遊戲難度，並且還可以重現那時的街機顯示設置的氛圍。 玩家也可以通過高分來與世界各地的選手展開競爭。\n請享受為視頻遊戲打造一代的傑作。","publisher":"HAMSTER","release":"2022-05-19","genres":["動作","街機"],"players":"單機 1–2 人","langs":["日文","英文","西班牙文","法文","德文","意大利文"],"pmax":2,"poff":2,"rating":"NONE","size":"Switch 2 0.1GB / Switch 0.1GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/4a10010dbeac35b4f655087334c0ec2c65cd3b822ecb2647c1eab2eaf5e7a522.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c08cffee74d7817ea731967b7c64898e044144210796047bd8e3d44d3abc2b59.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3cd8a9225afe49cd50b6fd5927662aaeda84b6aef67aaf6de5b202b45ab68541.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/dff0ad489d038e090d0ab64bd35a9f1752fe6036780b10ccb5bec84c94737e94.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/fb529ea8860017b111a23e703f6baee9a665abd614c070be2bebc6644b74a17a.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/c57d6d2048c6bf9bc18106bf92390dbd9ce0d125e1fe6fe2bd09208dad44fe61.jpg"],"titleId":"0100645016b38000","dlc":[]}